flowchart TD
    alert([Monitoring alert]) --> ack[On-call acks]
    ack --> sev{Severity?}
    sev -->|Low| ticket[Create normal ticket]
    ticket --> close([Close])
    sev -->|High| war[Open incident war room]
    war --> diag[Diagnose]
    diag --> known{Known issue?}
    known -->|Yes| runbook[Run the runbook]
    known -->|No| mitigate[Temporary mitigation]
    runbook --> fixed{Resolved?}
    mitigate --> fixed
    fixed -->|Not yet| diag
    fixed -->|Done| postmortem[Write postmortem]
    postmortem --> close
